<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Shanghai AI Laboratory<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">†</span></sup><span id="id2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> Project Leader, ✉ Corresponding Author</span>
